CFRG HPKE compatibility test data (source repository only)
========================================================================

The JSON fixture in docs/protocol/dmp-1/fixtures/hpke-rfc9180.json
contains a selection of public test-vector values and records from the CFRG
HPKE test vectors. The RFC 9180 reference identifies this upstream revision:
https://github.com/cfrg/draft-irtf-cfrg-hpke/blob/5f503c564da00b0687b3de75f1dfbdfc4079ad31/test-vectors.json

The upstream repository's contribution policy describes its materials as
IETF contributions subject to BCP 78, BCP 79 and the IETF Trust Legal
Provisions: https://github.com/cfrg/draft-irtf-cfrg-hpke/blob/5f503c564da00b0687b3de75f1dfbdfc4079ad31/CONTRIBUTING.md
RFC 9180 identifies copyright (c) 2022 IETF Trust and its document authors
and identifies itself as an IRTF-stream document:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9180.html

The applicable permission and notice requirements for this particular
selection remain under review. In particular, the IETF Trust Legal Provisions
state that their Section 4 does not apply to IRTF-stream documents. Do not
assume that the project Apache-2.0 license applies to this third-party data.
The fixture is not included in the SDK's configured npm package file list.
